Maid Atelier UI Bundle
======================

This repository combines two modified community plugins for DeepSeek Harness:

- Maid Atelier, based on Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale.
- DSH Side Panel, based on ccq1/dsh-side-panel.

The repository is unofficial and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
DeepSeek, DeepSeek Harness, or either upstream maintainer. Each plugin keeps
its own controlling licence, attribution, modification notice, and third-party
notices. See LICENSE_SCOPE.md for the path-by-path map.
